5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need a fair way to handle the bike spaces. I think we should look at the history of how this has been managed.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, dear. It would be lovely if we could find a solution that keeps everyone smiling and avoids any friction.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make sure we don't just guess! I want to know the actual numbers and what's happening around us.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,We must be practical. A system is only as good as the person who has to maintain it every month.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to help! I want to know if the current spots are actually being used by the people who have them!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll check the ""Last year's complaint log entries"" and the ""Account from the neighbouring block's secretary"" to see how other buildings handle this.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I will look into the ""Morning departures watched from the entrance"" and the ""Rain exposure along the parking rows"" to see the daily struggle.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm going for the ""The building account's two-year ledger"" and ""The ward cycle park by the station"" to get a sense of the costs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,"I'll examine the ""Treasurer's handover file on cash collections"" and the ""Trial of the supplier's display frame"" to gauge the workload.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'll check the ""Five years of association minutes"" and the ""Sticker register and the daily riders"" to see who's who!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
